      "name": "HyperFrames — media-treatment recipes (Two-Ink, Ordered Palette Dither)",
      "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/main/skills/media-use/references/media-treatment-recipes.md"
    },
    {
      "n": 41,
      "name": "Monika Zagrobelna (Envato Tuts+) — How to create photocopy and xerox textures",
      "url": "https://design.tutsplus.com/tutorials/how-to-create-photocopy-and-xerox-textures--cms-109034"
    },
    {
      "n": 42,
      "name": "Photoshop Roadmap — Colorful xerox photocopy effect",
      "url": "https://www.photoshoproadmap.com/create-a-colorful-xerox-photocopy-effect-in-photoshop/"
    },
    {
      "n": 43,
      "name": "Matt DesLauriers — riso-colors (Riso inks from stencil.wiki)",
      "url": "https://github.com/mattdesl/riso-colors"
    }
  ]
}
